{
  "_about": "Typed answers (keyboard) against a stored key: ONE rule for diagnostic-service (tests/test_e7_keyboard_answers.py) and exam-service (answer_utils.check_open_answer). The same value written another way is correct (0,5 = 1/2 = \\dfrac{1}{2}; нет корней = \\varnothing), an unreduced fraction (42/10 for 21/5, 2/4, -6/2, 10/2), a number without the leading digit (.5) and a rounded decimal are not; a mixed number is whole + fraction (2 1/5 = 11/5). 'accept' - typed text both services grade correct for the key; 'reject' - both grade wrong; 'contested' - cases kept as a record, each with the verdict of each service (equal today).",
